WEBVTT

00:00:18.710 --> 00:00:22.710
Such a pretty scream...

00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:24.370
What's going on here!?

00:00:34.390 --> 00:00:39.380
If you come close to me,
your body will melt.

00:00:44.900 --> 00:00:50.570
<i>That's how it always starts...</i>
<i>under the azure sky</i>

00:00:50.570 --> 00:00:57.740
<i>After making a vow,</i>
<i>I now set off</i>

00:01:10.360 --> 00:01:16.870
<i>Yeah, the desert glitters with a golden hue</i>
<i>(The wind is scorching)</i>

00:01:16.870 --> 00:01:23.210
<i>I'm searching for a diamond flower</i>
<i>(I keep on wandering)</i>

00:01:23.210 --> 00:01:29.540
<i>Now, for the first time in my life,</i>

00:01:29.540 --> 00:01:35.880
<i>I live for someone else</i>

00:01:35.880 --> 00:01:42.390
<i>There's something</i>
<i>I wanna protect</i>

00:01:42.390 --> 00:01:48.900
<i>I'll never,</i>
<i>ever lose it again</i>

00:01:48.900 --> 00:01:51.900
<i>Resound,</i>
<i>my heartbeat!</i>

00:01:51.900 --> 00:02:01.900
<i>A heartbeat smaller and fragile,</i>
<i>but tougher than anyone's.</i>

00:02:15.020 --> 00:02:18.730
"Confused Cat"
<i>Lightly, lightly, floating...</i>

00:02:18.730 --> 00:02:22.360
<i>Lightly, lightly, floating...</i>

00:02:22.360 --> 00:02:29.530
<i>Carrying our feelings</i>

00:02:34.040 --> 00:02:35.870
I'll take that!

00:02:43.050 --> 00:02:46.050
Nothing beats a bottle
of milk after singing!

00:02:46.050 --> 00:02:48.560
But, if you're up here just
staring into space like that,

00:02:48.560 --> 00:02:50.890
a crow'll peck your head!

00:02:53.730 --> 00:02:56.400
Are you moon-gazing
with your cat?

00:02:56.400 --> 00:02:59.830
Oh, no! Does that mean
I drank the milk for the cat?

00:02:59.830 --> 00:03:02.340
I'm sorry, but I was thirsty, so...

00:03:02.340 --> 00:03:05.670
Hoooowever! It's also your fault
for letting your guard down!

00:03:05.670 --> 00:03:10.340
If it wasn't for me, you would've
definitely gotten pecked by that crow!

00:03:17.020 --> 00:03:19.750
A boy whose only friends are cats
can't look cool at all

00:03:19.750 --> 00:03:22.850
even when he tries
to act smooth, you know!

00:03:25.360 --> 00:03:29.190
At any rate, your friend
is late, isn't he?

00:03:31.370 --> 00:03:34.530
Wow! That's a pretty gun!

00:03:37.040 --> 00:03:39.370
But why do you have a gun?

00:03:39.370 --> 00:03:41.210
You have one, too.

00:03:42.610 --> 00:03:47.210
Tada! I may not look like one,
but I'm a sweeper!

00:03:47.210 --> 00:03:48.510
What about you?

00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:06.990
We're kinda alike,
aren't we?

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:10.660
I'll take this, too, okay?

00:04:13.670 --> 00:04:16.340
Ah, that was good!

00:04:16.340 --> 00:04:18.510
Thanks for the milk!

00:04:18.510 --> 00:04:21.420
Looks like your friend's
not coming tonight, huh?

00:04:21.420 --> 00:04:23.680
I think you've done
enough moon-gazing, too...

00:04:27.350 --> 00:04:30.020
See, you got pecked!

00:04:30.020 --> 00:04:31.860
Well, then, see ya!

00:04:41.700 --> 00:04:42.860
Hiya!

00:04:50.040 --> 00:04:54.380
I haven't eaten anything since this morning,
so... Now, what'll I have...

00:04:54.380 --> 00:04:56.050
You can't put it
on your tab any more!

00:04:56.050 --> 00:04:57.720
I- I know!

00:04:57.720 --> 00:04:59.390
This is my treat.

00:04:59.390 --> 00:05:00.990
Thanks a bunch!

00:05:00.990 --> 00:05:02.850
But, this is the last time!

00:05:05.660 --> 00:05:07.660
Cover my tab with this...

00:05:07.660 --> 00:05:10.260
Like I said, no one's gonna buy
such a beat-up watch!

00:05:13.670 --> 00:05:17.670
Why don't you quit your unstable job
as a sweeper and start working?

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:22.010
Well, it's hard to find
targets worthy of me, so...

00:05:22.010 --> 00:05:24.010
Being down-to-earth
is the best way to live.

00:05:24.010 --> 00:05:27.010
You've got kids back home, right?

00:05:27.010 --> 00:05:28.480
K- kids...

00:05:29.680 --> 00:05:33.140
Hang in there, p..o..p..s!

00:05:36.360 --> 00:05:38.030
Bread tastes best with butter!

00:05:38.030 --> 00:05:39.360
Marmalade!

00:05:39.360 --> 00:05:42.360
Strawberry jam, strawberry jam,
strawberry jam!

00:05:42.360 --> 00:05:43.700
I said butter!!

00:05:43.700 --> 00:05:46.030
Marmalade!

00:05:46.030 --> 00:05:47.370
Strawberry jam!

00:05:47.370 --> 00:05:48.700
Butter!

00:05:48.700 --> 00:05:50.700
Shut up!!

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:54.370
Now that it's come to this,
I guess I'll go after some small fries...

00:06:03.650 --> 00:06:04.990
You go...

00:06:04.990 --> 00:06:08.320
I'm... targeting someone else.

00:06:08.320 --> 00:06:11.660
I heard that he makes
whatever he touches rot...

00:06:11.660 --> 00:06:14.660
Even though it's a 1.8 mil G bounty,
it's too risky...

00:06:14.660 --> 00:06:17.660
What a bunch of chickens!

00:06:17.660 --> 00:06:20.000
Welcome...

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:22.340
And, the guy I caught
the other day was...

00:06:22.340 --> 00:06:23.170
What the...

00:06:28.340 --> 00:06:29.830
What!?

00:06:31.350 --> 00:06:33.350
What the hell...

00:06:33.350 --> 00:06:35.180
Who the hell is that?

00:06:46.030 --> 00:06:50.030
Hiya, Annette...

00:06:50.030 --> 00:06:54.030
Hey, it's you, Sven!
So, you're still alive...

00:06:54.030 --> 00:06:56.200
Yeah, somehow...

00:06:58.370 --> 00:07:00.640
What's with the long face?

00:07:00.640 --> 00:07:01.570
Leave me alone...

00:07:10.650 --> 00:07:12.990
Aren't there any
good jobs out there?

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:16.660
Someone already
took the big fish...

00:07:16.660 --> 00:07:18.320
Missed it by a hair, huh?

00:07:19.990 --> 00:07:22.330
27,000 gold...

00:07:22.330 --> 00:07:25.990
20,000 gold,
15,000 gold...

00:07:27.330 --> 00:07:30.340
I guess I'll just settle
with this one for now...

00:07:30.340 --> 00:07:33.330
Tony Kaye for 50,000 gold...

00:07:40.010 --> 00:07:41.950
<i>What the-!?</i>

00:07:43.350 --> 00:07:44.680
Hold it, bitch!

00:07:44.680 --> 00:07:48.020
H- hey you...
I was gonna take that...

00:07:48.020 --> 00:07:50.420
This guy's too tough for you.

00:07:53.690 --> 00:07:55.180
Please help me!

00:07:56.700 --> 00:08:00.690
Some scary people are chasing after me!
Please! Help me!

00:08:02.300 --> 00:08:04.790
Okay, I'll kick their asses-

00:08:09.310 --> 00:08:10.980
Whoa...

00:08:10.980 --> 00:08:14.140
Ha! All that work on your
pectoral major muscle was a waste!

00:08:15.980 --> 00:08:18.650
I won't let you get away,
you bitch!

00:08:18.650 --> 00:08:19.320
Sven!

00:08:19.320 --> 00:08:22.320
--Come on, you bitch!
Don't give us any trouble!
--Somebody help!!

00:08:22.320 --> 00:08:23.990
Man, I'm not exactly
running on a full tank...

00:08:23.990 --> 00:08:25.820
It's tough being a gentleman.

00:08:27.990 --> 00:08:29.330
Stop right there!

00:08:31.330 --> 00:08:34.300
Now, back away
from that beautiful lady,

00:08:34.300 --> 00:08:38.670
or this gentleman will have
to teach you a lesson!

00:08:38.670 --> 00:08:40.340
What the hell's with this geezer!?

00:08:40.340 --> 00:08:42.680
What is this, some geezer with
a death wish coming to save the day!?

00:08:42.680 --> 00:08:44.680
Butt out, you geezer!

00:08:44.680 --> 00:08:46.510
Wow!

00:08:48.010 --> 00:08:52.850
I'm not a geezer!!
I'm a gentleman!!

00:08:54.350 --> 00:08:57.090
Now, mademoiselle,
let's have some tea, shall we?

00:09:01.960 --> 00:09:07.300
Gosh... Thanks a lot
for treating me to all this! Um...

00:09:07.300 --> 00:09:09.300
I'm Elena.

00:09:09.300 --> 00:09:11.970
Please don't worry,
eat to your heart's content...

00:09:11.970 --> 00:09:17.640
'Cause you...
saved my life!

00:09:17.640 --> 00:09:20.310
Well... not really!

00:09:20.310 --> 00:09:23.320
I wonder if those guys
really are bad guys...

00:09:23.320 --> 00:09:25.150
They attacked me
all of a sudden!

00:09:25.150 --> 00:09:29.990
To take down such scary people
just like that... You're amazing!

00:09:29.990 --> 00:09:34.660
Oh, that? I was just doing
my duty as a gentleman.

00:09:34.660 --> 00:09:37.000
Would you please
give me your name?

00:09:37.000 --> 00:09:41.330
Sven Vollfied.
I'm just a measly sweeper.

00:09:41.330 --> 00:09:43.000
You're a real pro!

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:45.500
Well, I'm not all that...

00:09:47.340 --> 00:09:51.680
Um... I would like to ask you
a big favor, Sven-<i>san...</i>

00:09:51.680 --> 00:09:54.010
Yes, certainly,
what is it?

00:09:54.010 --> 00:09:55.020
My little sister...

00:09:55.020 --> 00:09:56.350
Your little sister?

00:09:56.350 --> 00:10:00.020
I'd like you to rescue
my kidnapped little sister!

00:10:00.020 --> 00:10:01.690
The reward is...

00:10:01.690 --> 00:10:02.680
...this!

00:10:11.030 --> 00:10:14.870
We're kinda alike,
aren't we?

00:10:27.380 --> 00:10:29.370
XIII, here's your mission.

00:10:43.400 --> 00:10:46.890
We're kinda alike,
aren't we?

00:11:17.360 --> 00:11:20.700
I'm sorry! It's been a while
since I saw such a huge sum of money,

00:11:20.700 --> 00:11:22.370
so it was too much...

00:11:22.370 --> 00:11:25.370
What're you doing
with this much money?

00:11:25.370 --> 00:11:29.380
I prepared it as ransom money
for my little sister.

00:11:29.380 --> 00:11:33.610
But if you can rescue her,
I'll give it all to you, Sven-<i>san</i>!

00:11:34.880 --> 00:11:39.050
Do you have any clue
as to who took your little sister?

00:11:39.050 --> 00:11:41.050
I know who did it.

00:11:41.050 --> 00:11:44.390
Then, I think you're better off
contacting the police...

00:11:45.060 --> 00:11:48.400
They're a lot more reliable
than asking this guy...

00:11:48.400 --> 00:11:52.400
This is someone
the police can't handle.

00:11:52.400 --> 00:11:55.740
Who is this guy?

00:11:55.740 --> 00:11:58.410
Torneo Rudman...

00:11:58.410 --> 00:12:01.680
Torneo?
The arms trader?

00:12:01.680 --> 00:12:03.180
Yes...

00:12:03.180 --> 00:12:06.350
Why in the world would an arms trader
kidnap your little sister?

00:12:06.350 --> 00:12:11.020
He's actually a gangster!
What he's doing is just crazy!

00:12:11.020 --> 00:12:14.520
When I think about what he might have
kidnapped my little sister for,

00:12:14.520 --> 00:12:17.020
I can't sleep at night...

00:12:17.020 --> 00:12:18.360
What poor luck she had,

00:12:18.360 --> 00:12:21.020
being targeted by such
a troublesome creep...

00:12:22.360 --> 00:12:25.700
Then, does that mean even you
can't handle it, Sven-<i>san</i>?

00:12:25.700 --> 00:12:28.370
Ha! Are you kidding?

00:12:28.370 --> 00:12:29.370
Up against me,

00:12:29.370 --> 00:12:33.040
someone like Torneo is as harmless
as a little baby, mademoiselle...

00:12:33.040 --> 00:12:36.040
Then, you're going to save
my little sister!?

00:12:36.040 --> 00:12:38.710
Oh, Rins' deeply moved!

00:12:38.710 --> 00:12:40.050
Rins?

00:12:40.050 --> 00:12:43.280
Um, well, I liked the smell
of the conditioner that I used

00:12:43.280 --> 00:12:45.820
when rinsing my hair,
and it really moved me...

00:12:45.820 --> 00:12:49.280
Elena's happy,
Sven-<i>san...</i>

00:13:25.020 --> 00:13:27.490
You want more?

00:13:37.370 --> 00:13:39.200
Oh, all right...

00:14:03.330 --> 00:14:05.490
So, you like cats after all?

00:14:10.670 --> 00:14:12.330
Good evening!

00:14:17.680 --> 00:14:21.670
Could it be that you came here
because you missed me?

00:14:23.350 --> 00:14:26.350
Kidding, kidding.

00:14:26.350 --> 00:14:28.010
I see some milk!

00:14:41.030 --> 00:14:43.370
Boy, that was good!

00:14:43.370 --> 00:14:46.200
You saved me.
I was really thirsty.

00:14:48.040 --> 00:14:53.050
Could it be that you're using milk
to get me to keep coming back?

00:14:53.050 --> 00:14:54.380
So, I was right...

00:14:59.390 --> 00:15:04.660
You don't talk much...
Why don't you say something?

00:15:04.660 --> 00:15:07.990
Like, "it's a beautiful
evening, isn't it?"

00:15:07.990 --> 00:15:09.330
Strange...

00:15:09.330 --> 00:15:11.330
What?

00:15:11.330 --> 00:15:14.000
That's a strange outfit.

00:15:14.000 --> 00:15:18.000
How rude! This is the
traditional dress of Zipang!

00:15:18.000 --> 00:15:20.670
Look, it's cute, isn't it?

00:15:20.670 --> 00:15:22.010
Not particularly...

00:15:22.010 --> 00:15:26.010
In times like this, say "it's cute",
even if that's a lie!!

00:15:26.010 --> 00:15:30.020
I'll never say it!

00:15:30.020 --> 00:15:33.350
Well, then,
I guess I'll get going...

00:15:33.350 --> 00:15:34.350
Going?

00:15:34.350 --> 00:15:37.360
Actually, I've got a job tonight.

00:15:37.360 --> 00:15:38.360
A sweeper job?

00:15:38.360 --> 00:15:43.200
Yep. It's gonna be my first
big fish in a long time. Tada!

00:15:43.200 --> 00:15:48.030
This guy's the target.
Preta Ghoul for 1.8 million gold!

00:15:48.030 --> 00:15:52.040
He's a cold-blooded murderer
who's killed 16 people!

00:15:52.040 --> 00:15:54.040
He's an enemy of women!

00:15:54.040 --> 00:15:56.380
He's no ordinary murderer...

00:15:56.380 --> 00:15:58.780
Exactly!
He's a monster.

00:15:58.780 --> 00:16:00.310
According to witnesses,

00:16:00.310 --> 00:16:03.150
it looks like he secretes
corrosive fluid from his hands...

00:16:03.150 --> 00:16:07.990
--Because of that,
his victims all rotted away...
--Are you sure you can handle him?

00:16:07.990 --> 00:16:12.330
Oh? Are you possibly
trying to keep me here?

00:16:12.330 --> 00:16:15.830
Or, are you worried?

00:16:15.830 --> 00:16:20.330
Don't underestimate me! I can take care
of a guy like this with my eyes closed...

00:16:20.330 --> 00:16:23.000
Are you gonna kill him
with that gun?

00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:25.670
Killing isn't a sweeper's job.

00:16:35.010 --> 00:16:37.020
That's just being naive...

00:16:37.020 --> 00:16:39.350
A gun is a tool for murders.

00:16:39.350 --> 00:16:42.020
It depends on how it's used...

00:16:42.020 --> 00:16:44.010
Well, then,
I'm taking off.

00:17:32.010 --> 00:17:34.870
A- a seventeenth victim?

00:18:04.640 --> 00:18:06.500
Eighteenth victim...

00:18:08.980 --> 00:18:11.470
And here's the nineteenth victim!

00:18:17.320 --> 00:18:19.990
I guess you'll make it
an even twenty...

00:18:19.990 --> 00:18:23.660
I'm quite impressed that a young lady
like you came to pay me a visit!

00:18:23.660 --> 00:18:27.590
Preta Ghoul! I won't
let you kill anyone else!

00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:31.830
Are you saying you're
going to capture me?

00:18:31.830 --> 00:18:35.670
When I see a woman with a smart mouth,
it gets me fired up...

00:18:37.000 --> 00:18:40.300
Where are you!?
Come out, Preta Ghoul!

00:18:42.010 --> 00:18:43.240
There you are!

00:18:45.340 --> 00:18:48.410
You're my memorable
twentieth victim...

00:18:48.410 --> 00:18:53.180
Why don't you and me
have a lot of fun!

00:19:00.630 --> 00:19:02.360
Why are you avoiding me!?

00:19:08.630 --> 00:19:12.630
Oh, no... My <i>yukata...</i>
This was my favorite!

00:19:18.640 --> 00:19:23.140
Why? Why don't women
ever accept my love!?

00:19:25.650 --> 00:19:28.650
I've got so much love to give!

00:19:28.650 --> 00:19:31.250
Now, come into my arms!

00:19:34.660 --> 00:19:38.000
Monster! Get away
from that weird chick!

00:19:38.000 --> 00:19:39.670
Weird?

00:19:39.670 --> 00:19:42.000
Now, step away from her immediately,

00:19:42.000 --> 00:19:44.330
otherwise the next bullet's
going through your skull!

00:19:47.010 --> 00:19:50.680
To me,
bullets just...

00:19:50.680 --> 00:19:52.340
fall out, like this...

00:19:54.010 --> 00:19:57.420
Oh, it fell out, fell out again,
that one too...

00:19:59.690 --> 00:20:02.020
Things like guns are useless
against me! Useless!

00:20:02.020 --> 00:20:03.150
Is that so?

00:20:08.360 --> 00:20:11.820
My face...
is rotting, and falli-

00:20:15.370 --> 00:20:18.370
Preta Ghoul got arrested!

00:20:18.370 --> 00:20:20.710
Why didn't you shoot him?

00:20:20.710 --> 00:20:23.710
Hmm, I wonder why...

00:20:23.710 --> 00:20:28.380
Well, if I had to say, I'd say
because I didn't wanna shoot, I guess...

00:20:28.380 --> 00:20:30.720
I don't shoot
if I don't wanna shoot...

00:20:30.720 --> 00:20:33.390
Yes, that's the right answer
if I do say so myself...

00:20:33.390 --> 00:20:35.050
Well, then, I'll see you around!

00:20:35.050 --> 00:20:38.750
Don't worry. You won't melt
even if we shake hands.

00:20:40.390 --> 00:20:42.060
How are we alike?

00:20:42.060 --> 00:20:43.060
What?

00:20:43.060 --> 00:20:45.400
You said that the other day...

00:20:45.400 --> 00:20:48.600
Oh, that?
That was, you know...

00:20:48.600 --> 00:20:52.410
It was that both you and I
like being on rooftops...

00:20:52.410 --> 00:20:55.240
Huh?
Really, that's all!

00:21:00.350 --> 00:21:02.680
XIII...

00:21:02.680 --> 00:21:05.020
Belze...

00:21:05.020 --> 00:21:08.350
Why did you ignore the summons?

00:21:08.350 --> 00:21:13.690
Never mind. I won't
punish you this time...

00:21:13.690 --> 00:21:15.700
You've got an urgent mission.

00:21:15.700 --> 00:21:18.030
The preparation's complete...

00:21:18.030 --> 00:21:20.030
Are you really going?

00:21:20.030 --> 00:21:24.700
As a gentleman, I can't
abandon an innocent girl, can I?

00:21:24.700 --> 00:21:29.710
Be careful. That Elena woman
can't be completely trusted.

00:21:29.710 --> 00:21:34.710
It's against my gentleman's code
to doubt a woman in trouble, so...

00:21:34.710 --> 00:21:37.050
Sven-<i>san</i>!

00:21:38.720 --> 00:21:40.720
I'm... coming, too!

00:21:40.720 --> 00:21:41.390
What!?

00:21:41.390 --> 00:21:45.060
I'm worried about my little sister.
I won't be in your way!

00:21:45.060 --> 00:21:47.050
I wanna save my little sister!

00:22:10.210 --> 00:22:15.690
<i>The stars in the night sky</i>
<i>are my tears</i>

00:22:15.690 --> 00:22:19.690
<i>Goddess of the moon,</i>
<i>angel of the stars!</i>

00:22:19.690 --> 00:22:25.460
<i>Please stop time tonight!</i>

00:22:34.370 --> 00:22:40.380
<i>Please show yourself,</i>
<i>even if just a little</i>

00:22:40.380 --> 00:22:46.150
<i>Around the time the first evening star</i>
<i>appears, I hear footsteps approaching</i>

00:22:46.150 --> 00:22:52.060
<i>The only time I can see you</i>
<i>is when the moon is shining</i>

00:22:52.060 --> 00:22:55.060
<i>Please let me dream a little</i>

00:22:55.060 --> 00:22:58.300
<i>'Cause it'll become</i>
<i>an illusion by morning</i>

00:22:58.300 --> 00:23:01.670
<i>Even though I know it,</i>
<i>I still feel lonely</i>

00:23:01.670 --> 00:23:07.340
<i>The stars in the night sky</i>
<i>are my tears</i>

00:23:07.340 --> 00:23:13.340
<i>You held me in your arms</i>
<i>and your passionate lips met mine</i>

00:23:13.340 --> 00:23:16.350
<i>Please don't let go of me</i>

00:23:16.350 --> 00:23:19.680
<i>I'm about to melt in your arms</i>

00:23:19.680 --> 00:23:22.520
<i>But morning is almost here</i>

00:23:22.520 --> 00:23:26.020
<i>Goddess of the moon,</i>
<i>angel of the stars!</i>

00:23:26.020 --> 00:23:32.360
<i>I pray to you,</i>
<i>please stop time</i>

00:23:40.270 --> 00:23:41.370
"Next Episode"

00:23:41.370 --> 00:23:43.540
I'm infiltrating the big
gangster's mansion right now.
"Next Episode"

00:23:43.540 --> 00:23:46.180
"Why", you say?
Weren't you watching the show!?

00:23:46.180 --> 00:23:49.050
I came here to rescue a poor girl!

00:23:49.050 --> 00:23:52.050
But, that guy
showed up again!

00:23:52.050 --> 00:23:55.720
Black Cat! On top of that,
he's pointing a gun at the girl!

00:23:55.720 --> 00:23:58.880
Hey, stop it!
Don't you have a heart!?

00:24:00.320 --> 00:24:02.260
Looks like they found me
when I said that.

00:24:02.260 --> 00:24:05.230
"Cat in the Darkness"
What's with my life...
